  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Program to Support Access to Sustainable and Inclusive Productive Credit for Colombian MSMEs</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Programa para Apoyar el Acceso al Crdito Productivo Sostenible e Inclusivo de las MiPyMEs Colombianas</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">El objetivo general de la tercera operacin reformulada bajo la CCLIP es promover el crecimiento sostenible mediante el financiamiento de inversiones que contribuyan a la mejora de la productividad y sostenibilidad de las MIPYME colombianas. Los objetivos especficos del programa son: (i) incrementar la provisin de crdito para financiamiento de inversiones productivas realizadas por microempresas; (ii) incrementar la provisin de crdito para financiamiento de inversiones destinadas a la modernizacin productiva; (iii) incrementar la provisin de crdito para financiamiento de inversiones productivas destinadas a mejorar la sostenibilidad medioambiental de la produccin.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The reformulated general objective of the third individual operation under the CCLIP is to promote sustainable growth by financing investments that contribute to improving the productivity and sustainability of Colombian MSMEs. The specific objectives of the program are: (i) to increase the supply of credit to finance productive investments made by microenterprises; (ii) increase the provision of credit to finance investments aimed at modernizing production; (iii) increase the provision of credit to finance productive investments aimed at improving the environmental sustainability of production.</narrative>
  </description>
